{"final":{"answer":"The net change in net revenue for Entergy Mississippi, Inc. during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million (2003 net revenue of $426.6 million less 2002 net revenue of $380.2 million; components: base rates +$48.3 million, other -$1.9 million).","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t3c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}